    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let it crack open\"... i dont know. what if there's nothing to find when it cracks? what if the shell is all there is? it feels like everyone else is actually living, and i'm just... staying here because i'm supposed to. but it feels so much more logical to just stop pretending i'm even here.",
